{"generated": "2026-10-30 17:55", "brief": "<b>1. TPG의 롯데렌탈 1.3조 인수 완수 및 롯데그룹 리밸런싱</b>\n사모펀드 운용사 TPG가 1조 3,105억 원 규모의 롯데렌탈 경영권 지분 인수를 마무리하며 11년 만에 새 주인이 되었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBjZkJncWYtYnF5N2dseHdRR3dlM1p5STRXZXBIbV9wQVhXTnhMb2lLRUZVZUc5THN3Qy1nZHRSM1hrdlBQdS0xZmJGOFZVWHAyOTY2a0RiN29EdHJ2NHd0dkYwcHFMblBTTUtFSXJvUFMyR1hfanVRVVNSQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5ycDhGWVBXVW5NZ2pFN3hFSUFiR0VuNnJOeGdvc3VvWWI3TlZUQUFWbllqR0pCdGNCYm5KcW1wVFBiSjdTMmY2NEV2WS1qdzZ3SmIxREpudEpXM1p1aERTNEt6b0RjQXQ5dlBz?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>]. TPG는 인수금융 조달 및 공개매수를 검토 중이며, 롯데그룹은 이번 매각을 통해 실탄을 확보하고 포트폴리오 재편에 속도를 낼 전망입니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNOE1HZm4wS1cyZ0o4T25MUERvUExRLU15RElIU3JScVR2ZjhBbWxjbTNaWWY1dWRncFhEVVNaNTNhUWN0SW1adklCTV9FLS1feUh0V25TN3IzTk44enVKVDVDa2RROGZVeFd6UGQyRnhsX19JQnBPOFNHRDNkbzkxdnM3Z05kUTFqVnhV?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#15</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5ycDhGWVBXVW5NZ2pFN3hFSUFiR0VuNnJOeGdvc3VvWWI3TlZUQUFWbllqR0pCdGNCYm5KcW1wVFBiSjdTMmY2NEV2WS1qdzZ3SmIxREpudEpXM1p1aERTNEt6b0RjQXQ5dlBz?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>].\n\n<b>2. 현대차·기아의 자율주행 계열사 포티투닷 4,753억 대규모 출자</b>\n현대자동차그룹이 자율주행 및 SDV 역량 강화를 위해 포티투닷 유상증자에 총 4,753억 원을 투입합니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOMEhoZWJwWTlsSHZDeUFWby1aU09Ua3VpbW1yNGJBdDBNWHM0RF93ODVMcjRVWGJtNk5hWDJpdTZMVnJaTjVUaXNKYmxnT1hERzZNV2E1VnhUWDFsYXg4dDQzSnozclVSVVFEa1VZLXNLTFN0UmRURnIxN05ndi1GaHNwOA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE1idDBuWncyMUtNU0I2U3BFWWgxeTNLMzNWLTJUMk1GdFlpUi1mbTNhb0c3UmVOMWZEVXNTZlk5dWhpdnBxWjIybDZXalAzUEN